**Attribution Notice**: This software implements portfolio optimization methods
based on the research of Marcos Lopez de Prado. The original algorithms and
mathematical foundations are from:

De Prado, M. L. (2016). Building Diversified Portfolios that Outperform Out of
Sample. The Journal of Portfolio Management, 42(4), 59-69.

This implementation is provided for educational and research purposes. The
